! Cursor + fallback terminal (xterm) in the HUD palette.
Xcursor.size: 24
Xft.antialias: true
Xft.hinting: true
Xft.hintstyle: hintslight
Xft.rgba: rgb

XTerm*faceName: Fira Mono
XTerm*faceSize: 11
XTerm*background: #05080d
XTerm*foreground: #aacfd1
XTerm*cursorColor: #aacfd1
XTerm*internalBorder: 12
